/*!
* \page 04_known_issues "Known issues"
*
*The following issues and limitations are known:
*
* - Hardware:
*		-  ARM CORTEX 3 and above hardware - mbed enabled.
*		-  Sufficient amount of Flash memory and RAM.
*		-  SD Card and SD Card reader.
*		-  Power supply 3V3
*		-  Execution speed is slower compared to compiled code as this system has an interpreter engine.
* - Software:
*		-  Eclipse : Necessary to compile the system if you wish compile locally. See the Eclipse preparation section for more details.
*		-  Eclipse : Necessary to compile the system if you wish to compile locally. See the Eclipse preparation section for more details.
*		-  MBED-OS : On-line IDE. Notice that you cannot generate debug information from the online compiler.
*		-  MBED-OS : Online IDE. Notice that you cannot generate debug information from the online compiler.
* - System limitations:
*   - Arithmetic operations are not supported inside while or for loops.
*   - Numbers are rounded automatically during arithmetic operations.

*/